            {
                id runtime-diagnostics.relabel-carry
                title "Carry the source companion across a relabel: cg-relabel rewrites a .cg3b and leaves the sidecar describing the old one, so a relabelled grammar reports runtime failures with no location at all"
                priority 1
                kind @fix
                log (
