            {
                id deicu.stdio-shims
                title "Rename the ICU C stdio and options surface: u_fputc, u_fprintf, u_fgets, u_sscanf, u_strchr, u_isdigit, u_cleanup and the icu_uoptions module name plain Rust I/O and argument parsing after the C API they no longer call"
                priority 1
